45.2407%;text-align: center;height: 10px\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Application Begin : <strong>07/07/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Last Date for Apply :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b> <strong>10/08/2026 (Date Extended)</strong></b></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Complete Form Last Date : <strong>10/08/2026&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">NVS Class 6th Exam Date : <strong>28/11/2026</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Admit Card Available : <b>Before Exam</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Result Declared : <strong>March/April, 2027</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px;width: 51.1977%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Application Fees</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">General / OBC/EWS :&nbsp;<b>0/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">SC / ST / PH :&nbsp;<b>0/-</b></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / Online Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 96.4384%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">NVS Class 6th Admissions Notification 2027-28 : <span style=\"color: #008000\">Age Limit Details</span></span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Candidate Must be Born Between : <b>01/05/2015 to </b><b>31/07/2017.&nbsp;</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">NVS Class 6th Admissions Notification 2027 :</span> <span style=\"color: #008000\">Admission Notification</span></b><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 26.3108%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><b>Class</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 18.9299%;height: 25px\"><strong><b>Total School</b></strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 51.1977%\" colspan=\"2\"><b>NVS Class 6th Eligibility 2027</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 85px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px;width: 26.3108%\" colspan=\"2\">NVS 6th Admissions</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 18.9299%;height: 10px\">665</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 10px;width: 51.1977%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Passed the class 5th exam.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Spent/Studied full academic session in class III, IV and V</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 96.4384%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">NVS Class 6th Admission 2027 :</span> Document Required</span></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All the candidates will have to upload a photo, signature of themselves and their guardian.</li>\n<li>Aadhaar details/ Residence certificate Required.</li>\n<li>All types of certificates related to admission must also be uploaded.</li>\n<li>Example : Central Cast / Category / EWS / PH / ETC.</li>\n<li>Any Other Supporting Document Related to Admission.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"height: 25px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>NVS Class 6th Admissions are Released the Admission Notification Candidate Can Apply From <b>07/07/2026 to 10/08/2026</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Section of Sarkari Result to Find Application Form in NVS Class 6th Admissions Online Form 2026.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012)..</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 96.4384%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full NVS Class 6th Notification 2026 Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 96.4384%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 45.2407%;height: 10px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"3\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 10px;text-align: center;width: 51.1977%\" colspan=\"2\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"width: 96.4384%;height: 25px;text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 45.2407%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 51.1977%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"Apply Online\" href=\"https://cbseitms.rcil.gov.in/nvs/Index/Registration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 45.2407%\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>How to Fill Form (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 51.1977%\" colspan=\"2\">\n<h2><a title=\"How to Fill Form JNV\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3owyCfFzxLo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\