"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">1. When did the Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Class 6th Admission Online Form 2027 start?</span></span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process for Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Class 6th Admission 2026 started on <strong>07/07&nbsp;2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>2. What is the last date to apply online for Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Class 6th Admission 2027?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to submit the online application form is <strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"634\">10/08/2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>3. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">No Fee</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>4. When will the Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Class 6th Admission Test 2027 Examination be conducted?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The examination will be conducted <strong>28 November 2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>5. What is the mode of the Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Class 6th Admission 2027?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The NVS Class 6 application is submitted online, and the entrance exam is conducted <strong>offline</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. How can I apply for Jawahar Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Class 6th Admission Examination 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official Admission link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong></strong>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_25981\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-25981\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-25981\" title=\"Navodaya Vidyalaya Samiti NVS Class 6th Admission 2027\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NVS-Class-6th-Admission-2027-scaled.png\" alt=\"NVS Class 6th Admission 2027\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1483\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NVS-Class-6th-Admission-2027-scaled.png 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NVS-Class-6th-Admission-2027-300x174.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NVS-Class-6th-Admission-2027-1024x593.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NVS-Class-6th-Admission-2027-768x445.png 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NVS-Class-6th-Admission-2027-1536x890.png 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/NVS-Class-6th-Admission-2027-2048x1186.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw,